triangle-utils links Triangle 1.6, by Jonathan Richard Shewchuk, into its
library, as modified by MODFLOW-ORG/triangle; the modifications are listed
under Modifications in that repository's README.md, each marked in
src/triangle.c. Triangle's terms are in LICENSE-Triangle. The source of the
Triangle built here, free of charge:

https://github.com/MODFLOW-ORG/triangle/archive/7890e2724586cb0c20a221afb403e9df7627a849.tar.gz

triangle-utils also links shapelib 1.6.3, by Frank Warmerdam and Even
Rouault, which reads shapefiles, into its library, unmodified from its
release archive (src/shapelib/README.md). shapelib is used under the MIT
license, in LICENSE-shapelib:

https://github.com/OSGeo/shapelib/releases/tag/v1.6.3
